  "description": "Add pets to the quiz UI: rigged (skeleton) animated companions that are slightly active by default, follow the cursor with their eyes when standing still, blink and fidget, walk on top of UI elements and interact with each other (affection, small disputes). Pets always fit the topics of the quizzes; the architecture and technology site ships sunny (sun), cloudy (cloud), housy (house), solary (solar panel), radiatory (radiator), pumpy (heat pump), windowy (window), waly (wall), battery (battery) and more.",
